<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-mengxizu" source-id="s-songshu-047-mengxizu-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-mengxizu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">孝武大明初，諸流徙者悉聽還本，<persName id="c-songshu-047-mengxizu:p001:m0015" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABA">微生</persName>已死，子<persName id="c-songshu-047-mengxizu:p001:m0021" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABAA">係祖</persName>歸京都，有筋榦異力，能儋負數人。入隸羽林，為殿中將軍。二年，索虜寇青、冀，世祖遣軍援之，<persName id="c-songshu-047-mengxizu:p001:m0067" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABAA">係祖</persName>自占求行。戰於杜梁，挺身入陳，所殺狼籍，遂見殺。詔書追贈潁川郡太守。</p>
</text>
